Subject: [PATCH] Aurora segment palette and output file info on export success
 dialog

- Replace segment color palette with an aurora-inspired palette (violets,
  magentas, pinks, blues + warm coral/orange/peach accents), avoiding any
  green, teal or yellow-green hues
- Show output file name, duration and size (plus totals for multiple
  files) in the export/merge success dialog
- Fix merge success icon color (invalid 'success'/'warning' CSS values)

